  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NESA Center International Military Officers Forum 01-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This NESA event brings together officers stationed at CENTCOM Headquarters in Tampa, Florida and gathers in Washington, DC for a week-long program looking at various aspects of interest. This year&apos;s theme is &quot;The Biden Administration and Global Security&quot; with such topics being covered as the national security strategy, defense, China, the European theater, terrorism, WMD&apos;s, Middle East/Levant, and Iran.</narrative>
  </description>
